# Atmos TRS — Team Rules

This is **not a greenfield project**. Existing Flutter + Firebase code is the starting point.

**Workflow:** Inspect → Understand → Plan → Modify/Extend → Verify.

Understand the tourism registration system broadly. **Primary ownership:** LGU municipal tourism + DOT/OPTACA reports (and related seeding). Other roles are in-repo and fair game when the user asks — do not drive-by edit them.

Handoff / new-account briefing: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.  
Detailed specs: `.cursor/rules/atmos-product-workflow.mdc`, `docs/atmos-forms-and-establishment-qr.md`, and `docs/` (TEST_ACCOUNTS_REPORTS, DOT/Firestore).

## Who we are

Atmos TRS (Misamis Occidental) — tourist registration, QR check-in, LGU municipal tourism, OPTACA / Provincial Tourism, Governor analytics, establishments, DOT report export.

**Roles (do not invent new ones):** `tourist`, `tourism` / `tourism_office` (LGU), `provincial_tourism` / `tourism_province` (OPTACA), `governor`, `tourism_establishment`.

Canonical profile shape: `lib/services/user_directory_service.dart`, `lib/config/session_storage.dart`.

